NVIDIA Isaac Sim asset library
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Portions of the PhysX 2F-85 gripper asset (grippers/Gripper_2F85/), including
its materials (grippers/Gripper_2F85/materials/), were originally copied and
adapted from the Robotiq 2F-85 asset in the NVIDIA Isaac Sim / SimReady asset
library. These files were subsequently modified by Robotiq (physics tuning,
joint-limit corrections, variant setup, and substitution of Robotiq's own CAD
visual meshes).

The original NVIDIA work is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.
A copy of that license is included alongside the affected files at
grippers/Gripper_2F85/LICENSE and grippers/Gripper_2F85/materials/LICENSE, and
those files remain governed by it. Original author: NVIDIA Corporation.
Modifications: Copyright (c) 2026, ROBOTIQ.

MuJoCo Menagerie (Newton 2F-85 physics model)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The physics model of the Newton 2F-85 gripper asset
(grippers/Gripper_2F85_newton/) -- bodies, masses and inertias, joints, the
five-bar loop closure, and the contact/friction tuning -- is derived from the
Robotiq 2F-85 model in the MuJoCo Menagerie
(https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_menagerie/tree/main/robotiq_2f85),
which is in turn derived from the ROS-Industrial URDF description. The visual
meshes in this asset are Robotiq's own CAD and are not from Menagerie.

The Menagerie model is released under the BSD 3-Clause License:

    Copyright (c) 2013, ROS-Industrial

The full license text is available with the source above. Modifications and
additions by Robotiq are Copyright (c) 2026, ROBOTIQ.
